  - lineId: 17F02_TerminalSignoff_A_FieldUnit_001
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Correct disposition. Restart signal sent. The repair module will activate
      within thirty seconds. Stability is projected to return to the safe range within
      twenty-four hours.
    holdSeconds: 10.5839615
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 41f35d8e45f4d5545a550a87b2d4e25f, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_TerminalSignoff_A_FieldUnit_002
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: The household will also enter a fourteen-day priority watch. If the relationship
      becomes unstable again, I will flag it. Two reviews completed within specification
      tonight, Inspector.
    holdSeconds: 10.96132
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 39408c4ef12c6c843acfa0d9683730ee, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_TerminalSignoff_A_17F02_TerminalSignoff_B_FieldUnit_001
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Next, proceed to 17F-03 for the final inspection on tonight's route.
    holdSeconds: 5.3009434
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 66e8f2982663c3f41ba89a4cbc5bf80d, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_TerminalSignoff_A_17F02_TerminalSignoff_B_FieldUnit_002
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Inspector, 17F-03 went offline ten minutes ago. Remote restart failed,
      but the corridor terminal can still read the household file. You'll need emergency
      entry for the repair.
    holdSeconds: 11.338679
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4d7bc016689c61b488f5c63f84a083ee, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
